  "body": "Somehow during a bad shutdown related to the server running out of memory the PID file was empty and synctl kept crashing from [this](https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/develop/synapse/_scripts/synctl.py#L105) line because `ValueError: invalid literal for int() with base 10: ''`, file empty\r\n\r\nI fixed it by deleting the PID file You might want to handle this case better though",
